  effective M is block-upper-triangular: [[A,B,Cc],[0,E,-G⁻¹Bᵀ],[0,0,-Aᵀ]]
  A-block: [A1,A2]                         -> A   (Levi so(2,1) closes)
  E-block: [E1,E2]                         -> E   (core so(G) closes)
  B-block: A·B - B·E  (A on W, E on C)      -> B   (module: Levi⊕core act on module)
